  m_Name: LolaBebang_W79_Teach
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueNode
  speakerName: Lola Bebang
  speakerPortrait: {fileID: 0}
  dialogueText: 'Adda dagiti oras a kayattayo a maawatan ti rason iti likudan ti
    maysa a banag.


    Iti Ilokano, ti ''apay'' ket kayatna a saoen ti ''why.''


    Usarem
    daytoy no damagem ti rason wenno ilawlawag ti maysa a banag.


    Denggem a
    naimbag: apay.


    Ita, padasem nga ibagam ti ''apay'' iti bukodmo a timek.'
  translatedText: 'Sometimes we want to understand the reason behind something.

    In
    Ilokano, ''apay'' means ''why.''

    Use it when asking for a reason or explanation.

    Now,
    try saying ''apay'' yourself.'
